#: kgamma.cpp:492
msgid ""
"<h1>Monitor Gamma</h1> This is a tool for monitor calibration. Use the four "
"sliders to define the gamma correction either as a single value, or "
"separately for the red, green and blue components. You may need to correct "
"the brightness and contrast settings of your monitor for good results. The "
"test images helps you to find proper settings.<br> If the checkbox is "
"checked, the settings will be stored to XF86Config. This are system wide "
"settings, root access is required for that. If not, the settings will be "
"stored in the users config file, and will be restored at next KDE startup of "
"this user."
msgstr ""
